; The reduced 3DS material model's rigid lit vertex (RFC 0026): a model
; draw whose vertices stay where the frontend keeps them (CoreMeshStreams)
; and have no bones: v0 the position and v1 the normal in object space, v3
; the uv; the palette's first bone (c35-c37) is the model matrix. Linked
; with lit_bones_main.pica, model_lighting.pica and skin_rigid.pica, in that
; order. Out as surface_lit.v.pica.
